<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Heaven Knows</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">54 Ultra</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Heaven Knows</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">5Hg1m5uhSPL75ejQgPOmyc</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.179" end="00:03.257">Ooh, ooh, ooh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:03.257" end="00:05.835">Ooh, ooh, ooh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:05.835" end="00:10.226">Ooh, ooh, ooh, ooh, ooh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.226" end="00:12.538">Oh, I know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.538" end="00:15.116">It’s been a while</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.116" end="00:20.413">Since I found you here in my light</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.413" end="00:26.429">And by design, I pass you by</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.429" end="00:32.679">Heaven knows it’s what you want every time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.679" end="00:38.101">‘Cause you’re all I need</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.101" end="00:44.898">But I know you’re gone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.898" end="00:47.549">Ooh, baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.549" end="00:50.158">Why don’t we take it?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.158" end="00:55.421">Why don’t we take it from the start? Ooh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.421" end="00:58.436">Ooh, ooh, ooh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.436" end="01:00.968">Ooh, ooh, ooh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.968" end="01:06.266">Ooh, ooh, ooh, ooh, ooh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.266" end="01:08.264">Perdóname</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.264" end="01:10.796">Cada momento</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.796" end="01:13.608">Sin tu cariño</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.608" end="01:17.238">Me está haciendo daño</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.238" end="01:19.285">Y cada vez</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.285" end="01:21.894">Qué recuerdo</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.894" end="01:24.175">Lo que yo he hecho</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.175" end="01:28.065">Yo quiero volver</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.065" end="01:30.559">Me muero aquí por ti</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.559" end="01:33.566">Y no piensas en mí</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.566" end="01:35.863">Cariño, no me dejes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.863" end="01:38.660">Sin tu amor</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.660" end="01:44.097">‘Cause you are for me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.097" end="01:50.894">And I know you are mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.894" end="01:53.277">Ooh, baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.277" end="01:56.311">Why doncha’ save me?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.311" end="02:00.007">Heaven must be what you are</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.007" end="02:01.507">And that is why</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.999" end="02:03.546">Heaven knows I love you, baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.546" end="02:06.546">Heaven knows I love you, baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.546" end="02:09.470">Heaven knows I love you, baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.470" end="02:11.967">Heaven knows I love you, baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.967" end="02:13.717">Heaven knows I love you, baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.717" end="02:16.467">(Oh, yes, I know) Heaven knows I love you, baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.467" end="02:19.217">(Yes, I know) Heaven knows I love you, baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.217" end="02:24.358">‘Cause heaven knows I love you, baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.358" end="02:27.092">Escúchame, nena</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.092" end="02:29.576">No sé si me amas</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.576" end="02:31.342">Pero te lo diré</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.342" end="02:32.951">En una canción</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:32.951" end="02:34.451">Que dice</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.935" end="02:35.607">Heaven must be what you are</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:35.607" end="02:37.107" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(heaven must be what you are)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.497" end="02:39.388">Heaven must be what you are</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:39.388" end="02:40.952">Ooh, heaven must be what you are</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.952" end="02:44.217" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(heaven must be what you are)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:44.217" end="02:45.717">Heaven must be what you are</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:45.139" end="02:47.654">Heaven must be what you are</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:47.654" end="02:50.404" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Heaven, heaven, heaven, heaven)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:50.404" end="02:51.904">Heaven must be what you are</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:51.904" end="02:55.904">It’s what you are</p></div></body></tt>